{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00988","headline":"横吹曲辞 关山月 · 长孙佐辅","name":"横吹曲辞 关山月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凄凄还切切，戍客多离别。\n何处最伤心？关山见秋月。\n关月竟如何？由来远近过。\n始经玄兔塞，终绕白狼河。\n忽忆秦楼妇，流光应共有。\n已得竝蛾眉，还知揽纤手。\n去岁照同行，比翼复连形。\n今宵照独立，顾影自茕茕。\n余晖渐西落，夜夜看如昨。\n借问映旌旗，何如鉴帷幕。\n拂晓朔风悲，蓬惊雁不飞。\n几时征戍罢，还向月中归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙佐辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}